{
  "name": "Infinite Dungeons",
  "short_name": "Infinite Dungeons",
  "description": "Head down a bottomless dungeon with your friends, through the Smoldering Crypt and the lava and furnaces of The Sunken Forge: smash skeletons and forge brutes, grab rarer and rarer weapons, bring down the Bone Colossus, the Ossuary Warden and The Forgemaster, then leave with your loot or go deeper.",
